        <mxCell id="e8" value="CDC events" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="h_cass" target="h_redis">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e9" value="read leaderboard" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;dashed=1;" edge="1" parent="1" source="h_api" target="h_redis">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="h_refine" value="Deep-Dive Refinements (final, as you concluded):&#10;&#10;1. Leaderboard is NOT a Cassandra table sorted by score&#10;   (score = mutable clustering key =&gt; every change is delete+reinsert).&#10;   -&gt; Redis SHARDED ZSET per contest:&#10;      ZADD = O(log n) score update, ZREVRANGE = Top-K.&#10;      Global Top-100 = pull top-100 from each shard, then merge.&#10;&#10;2. Idempotent scoring under at-least-once:&#10;   CAS on submission status (only executing-&gt;accepted applies score);&#10;   store ABSOLUTE best per (user, problem), never blind increment.&#10;&#10;3. Autoscale execution fleet on KAFKA CONSUMER LAG (not CPU);&#10;   pre-warmed sandbox pool to beat container cold-start.&#10;&#10;4. Graceful degradation: submits still succeed (queue decouples);&#10;   verdict latency + leaderboard freshness degrade under spike.&#10;&#10;5. Freshness SLA metric: now - last_applied_score_event_ts&#10;   on the CDC-&gt;Redis leg (ingestion lag won't catch a stall there)." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=6;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1080" y="990" width="470" height="450" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="opt_h" value="================  OPTIMAL HLD (Reference — senior strong-hire)  ================" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;fontSize=15;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#990000;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="20" y="1620" width="1200" height="30" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
